.TH SANCHALA-HOT-CORNERS 1 "2024" "Sanchala OS" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sanchala-hot-corners \- Screen corner actions (macOS-style)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sanchala-hot-corners
[\fIcommand\fR] [\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Trigger actions when moving the mouse to screen corners.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B status
Show current corner assignments
.TP
.B set \fIcorner\fR \fIaction\fR
Set action for corner
.TP
.B enable
Enable hot corners
.TP
.B disable
Disable hot corners
.TP
.B actions
List available actions
.TP
.B delay \fIms\fR
Set activation delay in milliseconds
.SH CORNERS
top-left, top-right, bottom-left, bottom-right
.SH ACTIONS
none, overview, desktop, lock, sleep, screensaver, notifications, app_menu
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
sanchala-hot-corners set top-left overview
.TP
sanchala-hot-corners delay 200
.SH AUTHOR
Sanchala OS Team
